<p class="qq">What is the minimum front setback in Hemet's single-family zones?</p>
<p>20 feet in most single-family zones, and 18 feet in the smaller-lot zones <CodeCitation code="s312" label="Art. XI · Development Standards"></CodeCitation>. Eaves, bay windows and similar features may project up to 30 inches into the front setback <CodeCitation code="s1210" label="Art. XI · Projections"></CodeCitation>.</p>
<div class="cite"><div class="f">article_xi _single_family_residential_zones.pdf · p. 8</div>“Minimum front yard setback (linear ft.) a. Minimum except as provided for in b and c: 20 · 20 · 20 · 20 · 18 · 18 · 18”</div>
